,1.5,8,120,120,18,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.44,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It's not like we've seenDialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:06.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the end of the world with our own eyes.Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's why we gotta cast off - together, we can!Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Sailing from sea to sea,Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,saying it's nothing but a fairy tale.Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:38.78,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Truth is stranger than fiction, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.18,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you can't see it.Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Common sense is only what the majority says it is!Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.99,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It's not like we've seenDialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:57.41,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the end of the world with our own eyes.Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So let's go, Captain I'll-Do-It-My-Way!Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.67,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean, "no can do"?Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:07.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We haven't even started yet!Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:12.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I wanna know it all!  Now, yes, we can!Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!  You can!  This moment...Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can!  I can!  With this feeling of freedom...Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now...  Now, oh yes, we can!Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.52,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.60,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,koDialogue: 1,0:00:00.20,0:00:00.68,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:00:00.28,0:00:00.76,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,osDialogue: 1,0:00:00.36,0:00:00.84,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:00.44,0:00:00.92,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:00:00.52,0:00:01.00,Romaji-O