logue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:31.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I can help you, Pedro-san! Infiltration is my specialty!Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get a copy of the Poneglyph at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll be counting on you! Brook! Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Once we meet up with Sanji and Pudding, we'll be waiting for you around here.Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:49.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We all have to be really careful! Don't forget Pekoms' message!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:51.15,Note,,0,0,0,,TURN BACKDialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:55.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we decided to go on! We just gotta do it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:59.03,Main,,0,0,0,,– We're counting on you! – See you!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:03.28,Main,,0,0,0,,See you later!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:05.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Depth: 15 meters. Visibility: good.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It's going well!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go up the river, straight to Big Mom's castle!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope the river is deep.Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for this!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:16.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,Southwest CoastDialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Ya-hoo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:23.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I landed! We've arrived at Big Mom's island!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,– I smell an adventure! – I don't want one!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as we find Sanji-kun, we'll go back!Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:45.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji! Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:48.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We're here, as promised!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't shout! The enemy will notice!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:55.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you really see them, Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I did! I'm sure!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:02.57,Main,,0,0,0,,But when we looked, they were already gone!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:09.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Yummy! Nami, try and eat the soil! It's hard whipped cream!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:11.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Yummy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! It's meringue. Is this island full of candies like the others?Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I wanna live here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Around here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:32.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I saw Sanji and Pudding here, but when I looked away, they were gone!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,This is definitely the southwest coast.Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:42.31,Main,,0,0,0,,And you wouldn't lie about it, but I don't know why they would leave.Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:45.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna see Sanji already.Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:05:59.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,– Sanji! – What?Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:16.43,Main,,0,0,0,,– What happened? – Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:22.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji was there just now! Why is he hiding?Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:24.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Where did he go?Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:49.64,Main,,0,0,0,,We lost him! But this place looks delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:51.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a forest of sweets!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:53.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It smells so good!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:58.10,Main,,0,0,0,,If all three of them saw him, it had to be him.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:02.86,Main,,0,0,0,,But... why would he disappear?Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:08.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Believe this, if nothing else.Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:12.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to hide anything from my friends.Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe he feels embarrassed...Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji! Come on out!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We're here to pick you up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.26,0:07:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's split up and search!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going this way! Where you see a bunch of cakes!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going straight!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Where the sweet caramel-like smell is coming from!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:50.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll go this way! Look at those beautiful jellybeans!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:54.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! I don't want a secondary disaster!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! We just lost him, so all we can do is follow our gut.Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:01.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how people who get lost would think.Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Plus, aren't you guys being motivated by some other cravings?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.02,0:08:09.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Some other?Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.47,Main,,0,0,0,,No, we aren't.Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't lie!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:22.06,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! I'll search with you guys! All three of you, stay with me! Okay?Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm. Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:31.69,Main,,0,0,0,,– This flower is a candy! – Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:34.90,Main,,0,0,0,,This is where the caramel smell comes from!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet! It sticks my teeth!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:48.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:09:00.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Do you remember? We're here to pick up Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are too distracted by the candy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:05.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna look for Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:07.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I know!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.61,Main,,0,0,0,,But there are sweets everywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:15.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's strange?! We're in the enemy's territory!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll search to some extent, and if we can't find him, we'll go back.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:21.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This green river! It's melon juice!Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?! Let me try!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,If you take a close look at this bridge, it's a doughnut!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:38.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's enough!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:47.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Cross the bridge!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:53.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:10.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna take it down, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.05,Main,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:21.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, just humans...Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you think we were?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:34.98,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not important!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:38.65,Main,,0,0,0,,The crocodile is wearing clothes and a hat and he talked!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:41.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, this forest is dangerous and strange!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:46.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If that surprises you, take a look at us.Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I know what you mean, but...Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I think we'd better trust Pudding and wait by the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:12.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll bring Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,And look! Our road back is already problematic!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine. If we jump over the river, we can always go back.Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,There's another Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:42.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:52.81,Main,,0,0,0,,"Who are you"?! I'm Luffy! Stop mocking me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:55.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?! Which one is the real Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:58.53,Main,,0,0,0,,They move and talk exactly the same!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.53,0:12:00.49,Main,,0,0,0,,No, they're a bit different!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:12.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Like a mirror-image, his scar and accessories and everything are inverted.Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It really looks like there's a mirror! Who is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:23.05,Main,,0,0,0,,She's asking who you are! Answer her, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.26,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is! I found Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.06,Main,,0,0,0,,There! Up in the tree!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, you fool!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun, what are you doing up there?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:48.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's running again! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:54.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:02.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! You guys, go ahead! Chase him!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:04.20,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get separated! Chopper! Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,This forest is strange! Something's gonna happen again!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! But if we lose Sanji again...Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:20.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, go with them!Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:22.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you after I beat him up!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:01.86,Main,,0,0,0,,... Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:13.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:42.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-There's a gigantic half-buried man!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a Giant!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:49.78,Main,,0,0,0,,– You scared me! – We should be saying that!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?! Who did this to you?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:54.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:58.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Your body is half-buried!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm half-buried because I want to be.Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Is he stupid?! I shouldn't have been worried!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The thing is...Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna have some juice.Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care!Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.55,0:15:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper, don't take him seriously! He'll drive you crazy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, you guys.Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:25.23,Main,,0,0,0,,He's saying something.Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Ignore him!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I like apple juice very much.Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:34.12,Main,,0,0,0,,– So what?! – Don't listen to him.Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,If you go left, there are waterfalls of apple juice.Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I like them very much.Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:46.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember what Luffy told us? We should be looking for Sanji-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:51.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming?Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:55.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You're looking for someone, aren't you? He came this way.Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:58.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Did he?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:16:01.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I said "Don't take him seriously"!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,If you get me some apple juice, I'll tell you.Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Nami! Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,A rabbit?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Let's run!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.11,0:17:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There are talking trees and crocodiles, and the rabbit was trying to kill us!Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,This place is weird. Let's go back to see Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:12.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We still know the way!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.07,Main,,0,0,0,,But, what about Sanji?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:17.31,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't know if he was real or not anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We finally saw each other, but he didn't even get up!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:24.11,Main,,0,0,0,,He didn't say anything!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.01,0:17:26.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,And if that's the real Sanji-kun,Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,do you think he'd just stand by and watch us going through this?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:34.94,Main,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's go back.Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:38.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The needles are...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! The clock is like that, too!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.17,0:17:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything about this forest is strange!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:18.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Did you hear that?♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:20.28,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Yes, I did♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:23.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Move over♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:26.78,Lyrics,,0,0,670,,♪Tree, tree, tree, tree♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:30.21,Special-Captions,,0,0,290,,Whole Cake Island, Southwest CoastDialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:30.21,Lyrics,,0,0,670,,♪Close up their way out♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:36.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Flower! Flower! Flower!♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:39.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Let's play♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:43.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Let's play a murder game!♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.43,0:18:51.65,Main,,0,0,0,,– Chopper, can't you go faster?! – This is the fastest I can go!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he coming?Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:55.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's coming after us!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of this forest as soon as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:18:58.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:01.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That rabbit is formidable!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:06.16,Main,,0,0,0,,But he's not a Mink!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he a Devil Fruit eater?Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:12.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪They've noticed♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:18.17,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪The Straw Hats have noticed♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:20.01,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Us♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.01,0:19:23.22,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪– No, they haven't – There's something wrong♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:24.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪They've noticed♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:27.97,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪– Brûlée-sama is... – ... Playing with them♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:30.90,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Whose prey are they?♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:37.61,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪It would be delicious if we were to  make smoothies out of them♪Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:05.55,Main,,0,0,0,,See! He can't use Electro!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,– Carrot! Stay with us! – Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bird-san!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:15.69,Main,,0,0,0,,C...Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:18.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Crane!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:22.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Randolph – The Crane Rider The Big Mom PiratesDialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,– The weapon is... – ... coming towards us!Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.87,0:20:51.81,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's castle, Whole Cake Chateau.Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:56.19,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The lake behind it is called Lake Aprico.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:08.37,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Germa's ship! Requesting permission to enter the port!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:15.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Only the ships of Big Mom's subordinates...Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:20.21,Narrator,,0,0,0,,or those soon to join her empire, are allowed entry.Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.21,0:21:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep it coming! Keep it coming!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:38.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep it coming! Keep it coming!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:41.40,Main,,0,0,0,,All right. Stop right there!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Brace for the impact!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:54.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Germa is...Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:59.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,... the name of the one and only seafaring kingdom that has no land of its own.Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:03.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Several dozen of their ships  travel independently,Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:07.93,Narrator,,0,0,0,,but occasionally come together to form the shape of the kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:21.65,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The country is ruled by the Vinsmoke Family,Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.65,0:22:24.87,Narrator,,0,0,0,,which once conquered the North Blue by force.Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.87,0:22:27.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is the Germa Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.94,0:22:33.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Their army, Germa 66, is still viewed as a threat in the world.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:38.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Most of its citizens are men and soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:52.97,Narrator,,0,0,0,,There is not a day that they don't train themselves.Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go away already?Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.91,0:23:13.37,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you say that...Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:16.24,Main,,0,0,0,,... to your sister that you haven't seen for 13 years?Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:27.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I cut ties with you guys under no uncertain terms!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:32.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys must be crazy to put up a tasteless picture like this!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:50.85,Main,,0,0,0,,The big incident where four kings in the North Blue were put down.Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.85,0:23:52.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The Conquest of Four Nations.Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.28,0:24:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Our father's dream is to bring the North Blue under Germa's control again.Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:02.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's natural for men to be hung up on power and fame.Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.12,0:24:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you enjoy being a member of privileged royaltyDialogue: 0,0:24:10.67,0:24:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,rather than staying in a silly little pirate group?Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.80,0:24:16.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you.Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.51,0:24:21.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Look. These 10 waiting maids will do whatever you ask them to.Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:24.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate to ask, Prince-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.98,0:24:27.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice, nice!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.27,0:24:29.86,Main,,0,0,0,,That's because you're of royal blood.Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.86,0:24:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,If we keep sending our troops to countries in war, we'll never run out of money.Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.78,0:24:38.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't have to fight at all.Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.57,0:24:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you like the sound of that?Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.93,0:24:49.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We Vinsmokes have always gained wealth through our force of arms.Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:53.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You have that blood in your veins.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.41,0:24:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I care.Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.26,0:24:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna marry her!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.21,0:25:00.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding is a nice girl, isn't she? I like her.Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.14,0:25:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Generalissimo, where are you going?Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.14,0:25:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go see Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.27,0:25:07.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't bother me.Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.24,0:25:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Father-sama, why are you here?Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.08,0:25:31.67,Captions,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Judge – The King of the Germa Kingdom The Generalissimo of Germa 66Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.67,0:25:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you still whining?Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.47,0:25:36.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:43.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my son.Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.89,0:25:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't call me that.Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.69,0:25:49.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if I call someone "Father", it wouldn't be you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.62,0:25:58.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you do something to Yanji? He is quite strong.Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.91,0:26:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm stronger than him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.67,0:26:11.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Step outside!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.60,0:26:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Men should talk with their fists.Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.72,0:26:23.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Seducing WoodsDialogue: 0,0:26:24.77,0:26:27.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Carrot! Dodge!Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.14,0:26:28.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.15,0:26:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on back there...Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.18,0:26:36.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.24,0:26:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,He can serve as a landmark!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.66,0:26:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys from earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.74,0:26:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The field of lollipops!Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.71,0:26:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,A little more to go until we reach Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.51,0:27:01.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Outta my way!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.81,0:27:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,– He's still fighting! – Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.77,0:27:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the coast!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Why're you guys here?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.98,0:27:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! I'll tell you later!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:19.36,Main,,0,0,0,,This forest has a bunch of creepy traps!Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.86,0:27:21.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.37,0:27:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody's after us!Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.00,0:27:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of the forest as fast as we can!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.71,0:27:38.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the river where we saw the talking crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.67,0:27:42.70,Main,,0,0,0,,If I remember right, as soon as we cross the river, we can get out!Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.70,0:27:45.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's jump over it like this!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.43,0:27:48.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.02,0:27:53.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys! That's not the real me...Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.98,0:27:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you say something, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.19,0:27:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.36,0:28:05.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys! Let's keep running without slowing down!Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.20,0:28:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.21,0:28:08.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sanji?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:13.06,Main,,0,0,0,,He ran away from us and didn't come back!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.06,0:28:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with him, even though he sure looks like Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.63,0:28:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's talk after we get out, Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.09,0:28:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm glad that we still know the way!Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.63,0:28:25.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll reach the coast soon!Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.68,0:28:26.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:31.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.18,0:28:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,– Huh? – What?Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.23,0:28:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.61,0:28:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys again!Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.07,0:28:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you pull out the thing that's stuck to my...Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.33,0:28:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We just went straight back the way we came!Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.50,0:28:56.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.36,0:29:01.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't yell. It scares me.Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you ask why I'm here? I was here the whole time!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.01,0:29:13.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's you guys that left and came back.Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.82,0:29:16.94,Main,,0,0,0,,– Chopper, let's try again! – Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.81,0:29:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Pull out the thing that's stuck in my head!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Running through the field of lollipops...Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.58,0:29:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Jumping over the crocodile's river...Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.42,0:29:42.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the coast this time!Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.59,0:29:49.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You scared me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.01,0:29:52.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you guys keep coming back here?Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.81,0:29:57.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Again?! Even without the Log Pose working,Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:30:02.07,Main,,0,0,0,,we don't need to know the directions, because it's one simple path!Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.66,0:30:06.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Going straight back this way...Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.65,0:30:10.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Slowly... Slowly...Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.48,0:30:13.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Oops.Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.88,0:30:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Flower?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.25,0:30:18.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! The trees and flowers are moving!Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.12,0:30:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two!Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.75,0:30:23.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The soil is moving and talking!Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.17,0:30:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.42,0:30:28.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What are those things? What's with this forest?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.72,0:30:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,– They found out! – They did!Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.97,0:30:35.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪Flower!♪Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.72,0:30:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,There was no path from the beginning!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.31,0:30:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You finally became aware...Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,... of the terror of this forest!Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.80,0:30:48.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, what are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.80,0:30:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Seducing Woods!Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.66,0:30:54.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! That's not Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.42,0:31:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Who am I?Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.42,0:31:18.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We were together the whole time!Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you try, you'll never get out of this forest!Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.92,0:31:26.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Never...Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:29.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Not until you die!Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.32,0:31:31.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.48,0:31:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down, young girl.Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.48,0:31:39.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the scar on my face.Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.23,0:31:41.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Brûlée The 8th Daughter of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:31:39.62,0:31:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it terrible?Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.21,0:31:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you-teia?! A tree?Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.67,0:31:47.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not a damn tree! I'm Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.05,0:31:48.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée?Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:53.72,Main,,0,0,0,,A cute rabbit and a pretty girl...Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.72,0:32:00.18,Main,,0,0,0,,How nice... When I see those beautiful faces...Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.73,0:32:05.31,Main,,0,0,0,,it makes me want to scratch them up!Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.77,0:32:13.80,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance: Feeso Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi, Yibis (Karaoke)  Translation: Crunchyroll, Yibis (Opening)